  "core_rules": [
    "Examples teach meaning, not execution by ID/text. Current contract/capability/registry wins; add no hidden preset filters.",
    "CANDLE_STATE compares a candle's own close with its own open: BULL=close>open, BEAR=close<open, equal=neither. Candle side is independent of trade direction and is not TREND or MA alignment.",
    "CANDLE_STATE must explicitly carry side=BULL/BEAR and bar_state=FORMING/CLOSED. Current candle state defaults to FORMING unless a completed candle is requested. FORMING uses the latest price; CLOSED uses the most recently completed candle. Chart color alone does not define candle side.",
    "When a state must still hold at the final OZ alert, put it in final_conditions so it is rechecked at the alert time. Do not retain earlier state truth as a permanent authorization. Use steps for prerequisites or a sequence only when requested.",
    "Omitted symbol=XAUUSD(gold), TF=1m. Expand ranges/all TFs using current supported TFs.",
    "MA: 이평=SMA, 가중=WMA, 지수=EMA, 헐=HMA; positive periods. Only bare 50/200 implies EMA; infer no other family.",
    "골크=up cross; 데크=down cross. Alignment, price-vs-MA, slope and cross are distinct. Preserve CLOSED/FORMING.",
    "TREND/원비(WONBI)/FVG/올존(OZ) are public concepts, not formulas to invent. Keep explicit/inherited direction.",
    "Sequential works without timeout. within-N and active-for-M are separate windows. Unordered requires all events.",
    "State is not a new event. Consume transitions after step activation; never reuse old OUT/touch/creation.",
    "SAME_FVG keeps captured identity. OZ from FVG requires origin/start inside it, not merely current price.",
    "Nested OZ parent lives from alert to reverse-cross/bar-timer reset, not a price box. Invalidation cancels dependent children.",
    "Percentile/REGIME families=RSI/STO/DI/PRICE, independent. SAME_FAMILY links identical family; explicit family narrows scope.",
    "일반=NORMAL, 무지성=BLIND(validation); 브레이커=BREAKER(trigger). Keep modes separate; no implicit parent-mode propagation.",
    "Add no unrequested final OZ. Edit only requested parts of previous whole intent; user confirms before apply.",
    "BACKTEST keeps symbol/period/mode/job order. Counts=ALERT_ONLY; performance=virtual-entry. No silent model fallback."
  ],
